  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tunoze Gusoma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Rwanda):  ...With FY 2022.funds, USAID&apos;s Tunoze Gusoma (Schools and Systems) activity will improve.literacy outcomes for all Rwandan children by strengthening education systems. The.activity will improve language and literacy instruction in pre-primary and.lower primary classrooms by training teachers on evidence-based approaches to.teaching reading, increasing the availability and use of high-quality teaching.and learning materials, and training teachers and school leaders to build.children&apos;s social and emotional skills. The activity will sustain improvements.to early grade reading assessment systems, strengthen systems for the.continuous professional development of early grade literacy teachers, improve.resource management, and strengthen resilience to shocks and disruptions to.education. This activity will also strengthen deaf education in the country by.finalizing the production of the revised Rwandan Sign Language.Dictionary. .. ..Tunoze Gusoma.will help the Government of Rwanda develop the human and institutional capacity.necessary to sustain improved learning outcomes. As improved literacy skills in.the early grades of primary school directly contribute to children&apos;s success.and retention in the education system and their future employment, the activity.will contribute to Rwanda&apos;s long-term ability to participate in the global.economy, including trade with the United States, by building an educated.population... ..By improving.basic education service delivery and increasing institutional capacity to.deliver those services, this activity will contribute to USAID Country.Development Cooperation Strategy Development Objective 2: &quot;Improved learning.outcomes.&quot;...</narrative>
  </description>
